pe QueriesResultAccessor<TCombinedResult> = ValueAccessor<TCombinedResult> & object;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/lit-query/src/createQueriesController.ts:213](https://github.com/TanStack/query/blob/main/packages/lit-query/src/createQueriesController.ts#L213)\n\nAccessor returned by `createQueriesController`.\n\nCall the accessor or read its `current` property to get the latest combined\nvalue.\n\n## Type Declaration\n\n### destroy\n\n```ts\ndestroy: () => void;\n```\n\nRemoves the controller from its Lit host and unsubscribes observers.\n\n#### Returns\n\n`void`\n\n## Type Parameters\n\n### TCombinedResult\n\n`TCombinedResult`\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\nid: QueriesResultAccessor\ntitle: QueriesResultAccessor\n---\n\n```ts\ntype QueriesResultAccessor<TCombinedResult> = ValueAccessor<TCombinedResult> & object;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/lit-query/src/createQueriesController.ts:213](https://github.com/TanStack/query/blob/main/packages/lit-query/src/createQueriesController.ts#L213)\n\nAccessor returned by `createQueriesController`.\n\nCall the accessor or read its `current` property to get the latest combined\nvalue.\n\n## Type Declaration\n\n### destroy\n\n```ts\ndestroy: () => void;\n```\n\nRemoves the controller from its Lit host and unsubscribes observers.\n\n#### Returns\n\n`void`\n\n## Type Parameters\n\n### TCombinedResult\n\n`TCombinedResult`\n"}
